# TypeScript strict

`tsconfig.base.json` is already `strict` + `noUncheckedIndexedAccess`. Do not weaken it.

- No `any`, no `as unknown as`, no empty interfaces.
- Named types for public props and API payloads. Prefer generated types from `@namma-medmate/shared-types` / `@namma-medmate/api-client`.
- `import type` / `consistent-type-imports`. kebab-case files. No `console.log` (logger lib).
- `workspace:*` for internal packages.

```ts
// BAD
function handle(payload: any) {
  return payload.data as unknown as Session;
}

// GOOD
import type { Session } from '@namma-medmate/shared-types';
function handle(payload: { data: Session }): Session {
  return payload.data;
}
```
